WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.600
Welcome to Nashi. Your files, a little sweeter.

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:09.200
Choose a file from Home to get started.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:13.800
Open the conversion wheel and choose JPG. A JPG copy is created.

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:18.400
Drag to select a crop. Shift locks the ratio; Return saves a cropped copy.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:23.416
Recent converted and cropped files appear in Freshly made. Originals remain unchanged.
